      "content": "hobbies dont really do anything though. it feels like a distraction, a little band-aid on a wound that won't heal. the system is just too big. i'm just waiting for my time to run out, but it feels like i'm already dead inside, just walking through a life i didn't even choose. how am i supposed to \"find meaning\" when the whole structure is designed to just use you up and discard you?",
